# Scene1-1-23

; ========================================
; ●シーン1-1‐23
; [back 16]
; ========================================

; ========================================
; ＞『湖方面』を選択
; ========================================

; ========================================
; [bgm Bgm_005_001_Loop]
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:17_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_5_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛一行人去了外面，<br>来到了森林中某座湖的边上。|#0101Adv27_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:你来这种地方找什么？<br>我并不觉得这里会有什么<br>和诺亚被杀有关的东西……|#0101Adv27_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:正走在路上时，听见背后传来了吐槽声，<br>艾玛支吾了一下。|#0101Adv27_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（非要讲的话，<br>　我更多是想呼吸一下外面的新鲜空气）|#0101Adv27_Ema001|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:监牢的地下躺着诺亚的遗体。<br>想到这个事实，艾玛就感觉坐立不安。|#0101Adv27_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:抱歉，来这里调查<br>应该没什么意义。<br>我们快回去吧——|#0101Adv27_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀，似乎还有其他人来了这个地方呢。|#0101Adv27_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@HidePrinter
@SpawnExtended Path:MaskingRectangle Params:40,200,true,0.3,#000000 ScenePosition:20,50 Rotation:,,0 SubId:Front
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Rotation:,,0 Scale:1.5 Lazy:false ScenePosition:-20,36 AppearanceAndTransition:17_1 SubId:Front
@ModifyCharacterExtended Rotation:,,0 Scale:1.1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:20,32 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off SubId:Front
@ChangeActorMaskability ActorIds:MainBackground-Front,Alisa-Front Enable:true
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:MainBackground-Front Loop:false ScenePositionY:40 EasingTypeName:EaseOutQuad Duration:0.5
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Alisa-Front Loop:false ScenePositionY:45 EasingTypeName:EaseOutQuad Duration:0.5
@Wait WaitMode:0.4

[PrintTextModified Text:顺着汉娜指的方向望去，<br>能看到有一位少女正坐在湖边上。|#0101Adv27_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（亚里沙……）|#0101Adv27_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:MainBackground-Front,Alisa-Front Loop:false
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:MainBackground-Front Loop:false ScenePositionY:44 EasingTypeName:EaseOutQuad Duration:0.5
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Alisa-Front Loop:false ScenePositionY:48 EasingTypeName:EaseOutQuad Duration:0.5
@HideActors ActorIds:MainBackground-Front,Alisa-Front Lazy:false
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:MaskingRectangle SubId:Front LogWarning:true
@Wait WaitMode:0.4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:难得来一趟，我们去和亚里沙聊聊看吧。|#0101Adv27_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR7
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，那我就不和你们一起聊了。|#0101Adv27_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:欸，为什么？|#0101Adv27_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我虽然和亚里沙住一间房，<br>不过她超嫌弃我的。|#0101Adv27_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:我懂她的感觉。|#0101Adv27_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果我在的话，她估计就会发一顿脾气，<br>然后直接逃掉。所以我就先藏起来咯。|#0101Adv27_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（雪莉她能<br>　藏得住吗？）|#0101Adv27_Ema006|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛感到有些疑惑。<br>接着，她走到了亚里沙身边。|#0101Adv27_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:你好，亚里沙。你在这里做什么？|#0101Adv27_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:搞什么，别过来我这好不好。|#0101Adv27_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙明显地不太欢迎来客，<br>她咂了咂舌，眼神紧盯着艾玛这边。|#0101Adv27_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛虽然有些害怕，<br>可还是鼓起勇气向亚里沙踏出一步。|#0101Adv27_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你昨晚在过道撞到了我，对吗？<br>我想问，你当时在那边做了些什么。|#0101Adv27_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:你撞到我们之后……<br>我看你当时十分慌张欸？|#0101Adv27_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊？你们几个，<br>是在怀疑我动手了？|#0101Adv27_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:没、没有这个意思……！|#0101Adv27_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一到这种时候，你们这些人就只会说<br>都是我干的……|#0101Adv27_Alisa003| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:你惹我很不爽！给我滚！！|#0101Adv27_Alisa004| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1,ArmR4
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛和汉娜被臭骂了一顿，<br>吓得打了一个哆嗦。|#0101Adv27_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看来和她是讲不通了。<br>哼，艾玛，我们走。|#0101Adv27_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……|#0101Adv27_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:正当她们两个要转身离开时。|#0101Adv27_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:……我是想去看画啦。|#0101Adv27_Alisa005| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛听到了她的自言自语，于是回过头来。|#0101Adv27_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:画……你是说诺亚在房间里面画的<br>喷漆画……？|#0101Adv27_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙表情扭作一团，似乎很不愿意聊这件事，<br>但还是渐渐说了出口。|#0101Adv27_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我很早就发觉她是【气球】了。<br>自那以后，为了看画，我去过她那边好几次了。|#0101Adv27_Alisa006| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:昨天我也是去看画了，<br>但是正好碰到了那个模范生，因为感觉很尴尬，所以就回去了。|#0101Adv27_Alisa007| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（是这样啊……<br>　亚里沙是为了看诺亚的画才过去的）|#0101Adv27_Ema012|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:谢谢你愿意跟我说。|#0101Adv27_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙好像有些别扭，<br>她将石子丢进了湖里。|#0101Adv27_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:我想起我在湖边捡到了这个。<br>这不是那家伙在找的东西吗？给你了。|#0101Adv27_Alisa008| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙递过来的，是一根发带。|#0101Adv27_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（这个难道是奈叶香在找的发带…？<br>　不过，看起来上面沾着血迹……）|#0101Adv27_Ema014|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我先声明，这可不是我偷的。|#0101Adv27_Alisa009| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:总之，艾玛还是从亚里沙手里接过了那根发带。|#0101Adv27_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; 証拠品：『血のついたリボン』入手
; ========================================

@ResetText
@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:1-3
@ShowToastUI Text:"魔女图鉴 更新…|#Toast_001|"
@UpdateWitchBook Id:1-3 Category:Clue Version:1
@Wait WaitMode:i1.2

@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue LogWarning:true
@Wait WaitMode:0.6

[PrintTextModified Text:已经没有我事了吧，你们该滚了。<br>和藏在那边的苍蝇妹一起滚。|#0101Adv27_Alisa010| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:至、<br>至少喊人家【小仙子】嘛～！|#0101Adv27_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR10

[PrintTextModified Text:看来是完全没藏住。<br>雪莉从藏身的草丛中钻了出来。|#0101Adv27_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:顺带一说，我可没有怀疑亚里沙你哦。|#0101Adv27_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1,Option-ArmL-Off,Arms1

[PrintTextModified Text:哼，随便你。|#0101Adv27_Alisa011| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，有件事我要问你。<br>亚里沙你会用怎样的魔法？|#0101Adv27_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:……先说好，我没有故意要隐瞒。|#0101Adv27_Alisa012| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; [sfx 30：炎をぼっと点す音]
; ========================================

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_30 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Angle01/Option_ArmL+,ArmL11,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙在手指尖上<br>“噗”地点着一小团火焰，<br>就好像拿着一支看不见的打火机似的。|#0101Adv27_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Surprised1,ArmR15
@Wait WaitMode:0.4
@EmoteJumpDouble ActorIds:Sherry Loop:false Speed:1

[PrintTextModified Text:"是<ruby=\"pyrokinesis\">点火超能力</ruby>耶！<br>好厉害好厉害好厉害～！|#0101Adv27_Sherry008|" AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ShowToastUI Text:"魔女图鉴 更新…|#Toast_001|"
@UpdateWitchBook Id:Alisa Category:Profile Version:2

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉看到亚里沙的魔法后欢欣雀跃了起来。|#0101Adv27_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（根据每个人魔法的特性，<br>　或许可以推导出，谁有能力实施<br>　不可能的杀人手法……）|#0101Adv27_Ema015|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以汉娜才会第一个被怀疑。|#0101Adv27_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙这时已经没心思<br>和艾玛她们继续聊下去了。|#0101Adv27_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她无言望着湖面，<br>一丝寂寥挂在她的侧脸上。|#0101Adv27_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛一行人互相用眼神交流了一下，<br>便打算离开了。|#0101Adv27_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:正当她们刚迈出步伐——|#0101Adv27_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我很喜欢她的画。|#0101Adv27_Alisa013| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:便传来她的小声嘟哝。|#0101Adv27_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她的自言自语无处可去，<br>最终消失在了虚空之中。|#0101Adv27_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

